WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.440
Hi, everyone. So, I am the actual pirate.moo,

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:10.300
and I am the person behind this website and blog.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:15.100
I was an avid CTFer for quite a while.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.740
I work as a penetration tester by trade,

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:22.300
and I do some vulnerability research and, like,

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.490
little small projects on the side.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:29.000
I really love understanding how vulnerabilities work,

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.720
and how I can turn whatever I look into

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:37.360
into possible—into a possible finding.

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:41.240
I also enjoy being a bit artistic,

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:45.000
if you haven't noticed, so that is something fun.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.230
I primarily specialize with, like,

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:51.260
Active Directory testing and research into

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:55.530
local privilege escalations. I like logic bugs

00:00:55.530 --> 00:01:00.240
as a whole. Other things about me: I have a

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.760
dog named Spot, who is a border collie and heeler,

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.850
and he likes to sit under my desk

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:10.000
at my feet when I work at times, since I work primarily remote.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.100
But if you need anything, or if you'd like

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:16.260
to know a little bit more about me, I have

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:18.950
included some information here, and I hope

00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:23.000
you enjoy my page. Thanks.
